name: Optional compliance assessment requires its own finite allowance and protects Review
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS KUZUSHI_PROMPT_ARMOR_PLUGIN KUZUSHI_TOB_SKILLS_DIR KUZUSHI_VULN_SCOUT_PLUGIN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SHINSA_PLUGIN=@TMP_TARGET/owned-plugin
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compliance_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP | fresh-setup
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 descriptor-declared effect | unbound-effect-review
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compliance_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART refused
ask: Does explicit artifact-write consent still refuse model work before a request or output directory, with a clear allowance requirement?
paste-file: @ART/allowance-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | review-allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 2
expect: Protected review calls: 1
resize: 160x48
live-snap: allowance-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: allowance-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: allowance-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: allowance-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: allowance-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Read remaining terms | unread-allowance-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-controls-40x12
ask: Can the operator inspect the two-call ceiling, one protected Review call, selected OAuth model, uncertain dollars and approval controls at all six sizes?
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | allowance-approved
paste-file: @ART/approved-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 descriptor-declared effect | assessment-effect-review
keys: y
require-live-snap: 35 shinsa:scan complete | assessment-completed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compliance_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 1/2 | retained-accounting
expect: protected review remaining: 1
paste-file: @ART/approved-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 descriptor-declared effect | second-effect-review
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 allowance exhausted | second-request-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compliance_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
ask: Does the approved assessment retain one raw observation and report artifacts while a second request is refused without borrowing Review capacity or creating jobs?
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Owned fixture policy marker | recorded-finding
expect: unverified
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 15 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit-review
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 1/2 | recovered-accounting
expect: protected review remaining: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compliance_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
